6 Related Work
V ector databases.Milvus [3], Pinecone [5], and Qdrant [4] expose ANN with filters and
quantization but not native per-coordinate decompositions or layer-aware masked metrics.
ANN libraries.F AISS [2] and ScaNN [9] optimize large-scale search; explainability and
dynamic subspace routing remain post-processing concerns external to the index.
Explainable AI.SHAP and LIME [7, 8] approximate model behavior via sampling or local
surrogates. We instead exploit additive metric structure for deterministic, zero-variance attri-
butions aligned with the engine’s own ranking — closer to in-database OLAP rollups [10] than
to sampling-based XAI.
