7 Discussion
What we recommend shipping.In-database attribution and the M2 hybrid cutoff are the
two positive systems results of this paper. The gather kernel is worth keeping as an implemen-
tation detail regardless of traversal strategy. Verify is useful as an optional correctness/recall-
recovery modewhen combined with overfetch on coherent data; it should not be marketed as a
general recall-recovery mechanism given Section 5.7’s low-coherence failure mode. M3’sα-blend
should not ship — it never outperformsα=0, which is simply M2.
