Limitations.We did not build a dedicated high-Darchive for M1 (its collapse at highDis
evidenced indirectly via M2’s low-Lcells and the coherence measurements in Section 5.6, not
a direct M1 sweep atD∈ {768,1536}). We did not instrument visited-set divergence between
masked and full traversal directly, which would strengthen the mechanistic story in Section 5.5.
The attribution suite and masked-distance suite run on different hardware, so absolute latencies
are not compared across them, only within each suite. All reported recall/latency figures are
single-run point estimates; repeated trials with confidence intervals are needed before final
submission and are in progress.
8 Conclusion
XQdrant shows that exact feature attribution can live inside a Rust vector engine with negligible
quality loss and a clear latency win over client-side extraction. For masked-distance HNSW,
we report a more nuanced result: a hybrid layer cutoff is a genuinenavigabilitytool — the
only one of five traversal-level mechanisms we test that both keeps recall high and requires
